    <string name="tmdb_guide_button">How do I get a key?</string>
    <string name="tmdb_guide_title">Getting a TMDB key</string>
    <string name="tmdb_guide_intro">It is free and takes about five minutes. TMDB is the film database that supplies posters, synopses, cast and trailers.</string>
    <string name="tmdb_guide_step_account">Create an account at themoviedb.org. Only an email address, a username and a password are needed; confirm the email they send you.</string>
    <string name="tmdb_guide_step_settings">Signed in, open your profile menu, choose Settings, and then API in the list on the left.</string>
    <string name="tmdb_guide_step_request">Ask for a Developer key. Where it asks what the application is for, personal use is a valid answer; a website address is not required.</string>
    <string name="tmdb_guide_step_copy">Copy the API Key (v3 auth) — a long line of letters and numbers — and paste it into the field on this screen.</string>
    <string name="tmdb_guide_open_site">Open themoviedb.org</string>
