    <string name="legal_body_two">By continuing, you confirm that you hold lawful authorisation to access everything you add, and that you alone are responsible for the sources you use. The app does not bypass DRM, authentication, paywalls or any technical protection. If your source requires that, it will not work here.</string>
    <string name="legal_body_three">IPTV BURO is not affiliated with any provider, broadcaster or streaming service, and is not responsible for content delivered by third parties. Use the app in accordance with the law where you live.</string>
